  title: "A MOST CURIOUS INVESTMENT\t"
  description: "My Pontiff, an exotic merchant from the East has arrived at our gates
    with a most curious sob story: he claims to have brought a vast shipment of rare
    wares, but alas, when he attempted to sell them in the Agora, the guards confiscated
    his cargo due to missing permits and documentation. Having heard tellings of
    our sect\u2019s far-reaching influence, he begs for our aid in \u201Cpersuading\u201D
    the guards to look the other way. He promises our efforts will be handsomely
    rewarded."
